title: "ApertureDiv"
abstract: "Multi-aperture receive diversity for FSO — gamma-gamma and lognormal pdf and cdf, aperture averaging factor, inter-aperture spatial correlation against separation, maximal-ratio and equal-gain and selection combining, outage probability and diversity order, and the gap between correlated and independent-aperture idealisation; learned combiner weighting for the imperfect-CSI regime against the analytic MRC optimum."
